      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Good morning. I'll be exact. Three weeks ago I had a heart attack, a stent was placed, and I'm now on aspirin and clopidogrel, and I'm bruising a great deal. I wish to know if that is expected.",
